>Dipak K Dash</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135217454,imgsize-102908.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Who checks the power?' Ex-SC judge calls for safeguards in poll panel appointments]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/who-checks-the-power-ex-sc-judge-calls-for-safeguards-in-poll-panel-appointments/articleshow/135216590.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135216590.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Justice Abhay Oka presented compelling arguments for a structured legal framework to ensure election commissioners' independence. He cited Lal Krishna Advani's collegium system as a potential method for their selection. Oka placed strong emphasis on civil discourse as a pillar of democracy and raised alarms about environmental issues fueling rising temperatures in urban areas like Thane and Mumbai. Additionally, he recommended more efficient uses for public transport funding.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/who-checks-the-power-ex-sc-judge-calls-for-safeguards-in-poll-panel-appointments/articleshow/135216590.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/who-checks-the-power-ex-sc-judge-calls-for-safeguards-in-poll-panel-appointments/articleshow/135216590.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-26T23:02:11+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Vijaya Srivastava</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135216727,imgsize-75128.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Guwahati hotel shooting: Lease dispute led to firing that killed at least five]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/guwahati-hotel-shooting-lease-dispute-led-to-firing-that-killed-five/articleshow/135216174.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left