dia/travesty-of-justice-sc-flays-up-police-for-slipshod-probe-in-murder-case-orders-reparation-for-undertrial/articleshow/135214186.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/travesty-of-justice-sc-flays-up-police-for-slipshod-probe-in-murder-case-orders-reparation-for-undertrial/articleshow/135214186.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-26T20:28:39+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Vijaya Srivastava</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135214395,imgsize-829588.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Maharashtra govt forms SIT to probe Jaranage's 'Rs 500 crore' audio clip]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/maharashtra-govt-forms-sit-to-probe-jaranages-rs-500-crore-audio-clip/articleshow/135213965.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135213965.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/maharashtra-govt-forms-sit-to-probe-jaranages-rs-500-crore-audio-clip/articleshow/135213965.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/maharashtra-govt-forms-sit-to-probe-jaranages-rs-500-crore-audio-clip/articleshow/135213965.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-26T19:57:50+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Rohitashwa Ranjan</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135213969,imgsize-97976.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[‘Evil force’: TVK targets DMK after former minister Poyyamozhi’s arrest in alleged Rs 100-crore scam]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/evil-force-tvk-targets-dmk-after-former-minister-poyyamozhis-arrest-in-alleged-rs-100-crore-scam/articleshow/135213250.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135213250.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/evil-force-tvk-targets-dmk-after-former-minister-poyyamozhis-arrest-in-alleged-rs-100-crore-scam/articleshow/135213250.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/evil-force-tvk-targets-dmk-after-former-minister-poyyamozhis-arrest-in-alleged-rs-100-crore-scam/articleshow/135213250.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-26T19:44:30+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Karan Manral</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135213782,imgsize-60420.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[TRAI for mandatory authorisation for live TV streaming apps]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/trai-for-mandatory-authorisation-for-live-tv-streaming-apps/articleshow/135213226.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135213226.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Telecom Regulatory Authority of India has issued recommendations for a mandatory authorisation framework for TV distribution services. Stakeholders, including OEMs and broadcasters, will need to comply with new regulations for these applications. A one-time entry fee of Rs 1 lakh and an application processing fee of Rs 10,000 are proposed. These measures aim to protect consumers and ensure accurate TV viewership metrics.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/trai-for-mandatory-authorisation-for-live-tv-streaming-apps/articleshow/135213226.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/trai-for-mandatory-authorisation-for-live-tv-streaming-apps/articleshow/135213226.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-26T19:32:51+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Saura