ator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135213638,imgsize-244998.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA["Entirely unbecoming in a democracy": Pushkar Dhami slams Kharge over remarks against PM Modi]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/entirely-unbecoming-in-a-democracy-pushkar-dhami-slams-kharge-over-remarks-against-pm-modi/articleshow/135212892.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135212892.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Uttarakhand chief minister Pushkar Singh Dhami on Monday criticised Congress president Mallikarjun Kharge over his remarks concerning Prime Minister Narendra Modi’s father and targeted Samajwadi Party chief Akhilesh Yadav over his alleged use of the term “infiltrators” for the people of Uttarakhand. Dhami questioned the Congress party’s alliance with the Samajwadi Party, saying it must decide whether the alliance or the self-respect of Uttarakhand was more important to it.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/entirely-unbecoming-in-a-democracy-pushkar-dhami-slams-kharge-over-remarks-against-pm-modi/articleshow/135212892.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/entirely-unbecoming-in-a-democracy-pushkar-dhami-slams-kharge-over-remarks-against-pm-modi/articleshow/135212892.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-26T18:49:25+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135212891,imgsize-85064.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Broke locks, scaled walls: Congress MPs named in Jamia FIR amid students' unrest]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/broke-locks-scaled-walls-congress-mps-named-in-jamia-fir-amid-students-unrest/articleshow/135212570.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://tim